@startuml
skinparam DefaultFontName Meiryo
actor "著者\n(Author)" as User
participant "GameMaster AI\n(問題生成 / Problem Generation)" as GM
participant "コンサルタント AI\n(静的解析 / Static Analysis)" as Cons

User -> GM: 架空企業の財務・業務トラブル生成を指示\n(Instruct to generate financial & operational troubles)
GM --> User: 【純粋な現状レポート】提出\n(Submit [Pure Current Status Report])
User -> Cons: レポートのみを入力し、CAaOでの解析を指示\n(Input only the report and instruct analysis with CAaO)
note right: 事前文脈や結論の裏合わせなし\n(No prior context or alignment on conclusions)
Cons --> User: 【構造上の問題と処方箋】抽出\n(Extract [Structural Issues & Design Options])
@enduml